# appsql differ builds standalone; its lock and target are local.
#
# v7.40.0 — these patterns were `xtests/appsql/differ/target/` and
# `xtests/appsql/differ/Cargo.lock`. A pattern in a nested .gitignore is
# relative to ITS OWN directory, so those named
# `xtests/appsql/differ/xtests/appsql/differ/target/` — a path that
# cannot exist. The rule matched nothing from the day it was written,
# which is why 1,036 artefact files stayed tracked and why `git add -A`
# put them straight back after `git rm --cached`.
target/
Cargo.lock
